{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05038","headline":"奉和圣制同皇太子游慈恩寺应制 · 沈佺期","name":"奉和圣制同皇太子游慈恩寺应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"肃肃莲花界，荧荧贝叶宫。\n金人来梦里，白马出城中。\n涌塔初从地，焚香欲遍空。\n天歌应春龠，非是爲春风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}